        <body>
            <div xml:id="d15-a1">

                <pb facs="0089" n="19" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg19"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 1.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>The Ministers to Mr. Van
                        Valkenburgh.</head>
                <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. B. Van Valkenburgh,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States of America,
                        &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c. :</hi></p>
                <p>We have to inform your excellency with reference to our former communication in
                    relation to the navigation of the straits of Suwo and Nagato, that an armistice
                    has been concluded, as already verbally stated to you by a governor for foreign
                    affairs.</p>
                <p>If the war be resumed we shall give yon due notice.</p>
                <p>With respect and esteem,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>_____, _____,</signed>
                </closer>
                <closer>
                    <signed>_____, _____, <hi rendition="#italic">The Ministers for Foreign
                            Affairs.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>On the 5th day of the 11th month of the 2d year of Keill.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d15-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d15-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
